direction: right
profile: Existing Bazel SMP / C23 service
make: Existing Make jobserver
compiler: Known compiler actions / p1
artifact: Configured private products
tests: Original tests / own runtime population
profile -> make -> compiler -> artifact -> tests
stamp: Content-stable non-Git stamp
stamp -> make: avoid unrelated kernel rebuild
tools: Configured helpers survive bootclean
tools -> make
failure: Failed phase
failure -> make: stop before next phase
model: SysML source scope
admit: ASCENT five gates
model -> admit
tests -> admit
